The data files in this folder are the project's own computations from third-party
sources (selected, aggregated, imputed and reweighted). They are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Attribution: credit this project and the original sources listed in ATTRIBUTION.md
at the root of the repository. The sources' own terms continue to apply to the
underlying figures (for example WHO's additional terms, the IMF's permission
requirement for commercial reuse, and the attribution rules of UNHCR and the OECD).
None of the providers endorses this project.

returns_model.json holds only summary statistics computed from the Jorda-Schularick-
Taylor Macrohistory Database; the database itself (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) is not included.
